							<p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 24pt; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><font color="#ff0000">Roeanoke Evervigilent</font></span></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 24pt; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> <hr id="null" /> </span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 24pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></span></p> <p class="MsoBodyText" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.5in"><font color="#ff0000"><span class="typewriter"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><font color="#ff0000"></font></span></span></font>&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoBodyText" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.5in"><font color="#ff0000"><span class="typewriter"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><font color="#ff0000">66 seasons ago I made my way into Norrath. I come from Halas, a city of a great, strong and noble people. They call us the Barbarians. A rather large bunch, we stand taller than all the elves and humans of Norrath. As a young barbarian growing up, we are taught that only the strong will rise to power, and it is our place to crush the weak. I am proud of my race, though I never really fit in Halas because in my heart, I think the strong</font> <font color="#ff0000">should protect the weak, which often are fighting for a good cause. </font></span></span><span class="typewriter"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><o:p></o:p></span></span></font></p> <p class="MsoBodyText" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.5in"><font color="#ff0000"><span class="typewriter"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><font color="#ff0000">And so I left my</font> <font color="#ff0000">home when I was still very young. I became a warrior on my own; I went in search of a way to help these weak do-gooders. I trained myself well during the next few seasons, hunting many of the dangerous creatures that threatened the smaller more helpless races of our world. I quickly became stronger and mightier than most of my fellow barbarian warriors that were training in Halas. Many times others who felt the same need to protect these people would join me. It wasn't long before I was invited to join a guild of the most helpful and dedicated people I've ever had the good fortune to meet.</font> </span></span><span class="typewriter"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><o:p></o:p></span></span></font></p> <p class="MsoBodyText" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.5in"><font color="#ffa500"><span class="typewriter"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><font color="#ff0000">Moonlite</font> <font color="#ff0000">Redemption became a home for so many people whose purpose in life is to help, and so it became for me also. With this new support, I've been able to help in ways I'd never thought of before, I've even met people of raced I hadn't known existed! This group of people is the family I never really had when I was growing up. </font></span></span><span class="typewriter"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><o:p></o:p></span></span></font></p> <p class="MsoBodyText" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"><font color="#ff0000"><span class="typewriter"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color="#ff0000">It was not long</font> <font color="#ff0000">after this that I met Hieni. Hieni is a tiny woman if ever there was one. She's a halfling. She's the most beautiful thing I've ever seen! I was always a shy person, but it was Hieni that brought me out of that shell, and helped give me an inner-strength to match my physical strength.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp; </span>She</font> <font color="#ff0000">has certainly become one of the most driving forces of my entire existence</font>.</span></span><span class="typewriter"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><o:p></o:p></span></span></font></p> <p class="MsoBodyText" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"><span class="typewriter"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"><font color="#ff0000">As some citizens of Norrath were opposed to our union, Hieni and I were married in secret. I did not want anyone to ruin such a perfect time in my life. In attendance were merely Hieni, the priest and myself. It was beautiful in lake Rathetear on top of the Aviak tower with the sun setting on our backs. The date was February 14th at 6pm.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp; </span>That night, for our honeymoon, I took her to Twilight Sea and then back to our small, warm house. </font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> <p align="center"><font color="#ff0000"><img src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v511/Amyana/Hierachy/Roeanoke2.jpg" /> </font></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><font color="#ff0000">Roeanoke and Hieni’s Home</font></span></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><font color="#ff0000"></font></span>&nbsp;</p><span class="typewriter"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"> <p class="MsoBodyText" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.5in" align="left"><font color="#ff0000"><span class="typewriter"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><font color="#ff0000">Since the marriage, the beings of Norrath are facing an all out war. I’ve been called off to battle with my fellow guild mates. Hieni often accompanies me, but sometimes she must remain at home. She understands my duties as an officer and the warrior leader of the Moonlite Redemption. She always wishes me the best of luck. She is always there for me when I return home, even if I am covered from head to toe in the gore from battle. She ignores the stench, and heals my wounds with her love and her healing power</font> <font color="#ff0000">as a cleric of Bristlebane. </font></span></span><span class="typewriter"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><o:p></o:p></span></span></font></p> <p class="MsoBodyText" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="left"><span class="typewriter"><font color="#ff0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"><font color="#ff0000">We live in a secluded area of East Karana so we can be together in peace. Our respective races were not the most welcoming of our union, and offered little in the way of the support. We don’t have much, but we have each other. My armor is a bit rusty, but I always</font> <font color="#ff0000">do my best to keep hers in good form whenever I am able. Hieni is the most wonderful woman I’ve ever had the pleasure to know. She is always there to help and guide me. No one knows what the future holds, only the gods and love can tell.</font></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"> </span></font></span></span></span><font color="#ff0000"><img src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v511/Amyana/Hierachy/RoeanokeandHieni2.jpg" /> </font></p> <p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><font color="#ff0000">Roeanoke and Hieni Evervigilent</font></span></p> <p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><font color="#ff0000"></font></span>&nbsp;</p><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"> <p align="left"><a href="/custom.aspx?pid=1601"><font color="#ff0000" size=""><img src="/pics/1602/Fonts.gif" /></font></a></p><o:p></o:p></span>
							
